codex
Rejected honestly: the natural Hamiltonian-cycle family from [arXiv:1308.6717](https://arxiv.org/abs/1308.6717) fails hardness.

- Track A fails because Section 6, Theorem 5.1 gives a constructive linear-time method.
- Track B was attempted, but construction-aware guesses succeeded about 25–40% of the time. The adversary panel also recorded successes on three attacks, violating G4/G6.
- Generation and exact verification themselves worked.

Deliverables:

- [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1308.6717/REJECTED.md)
- [rejected_gen_1308_6717.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1308.6717/rejected_gen_1308_6717.py)

The retained module compiles and its planted witnesses verify across all four presets. No paid LLM hardening run was performed because STEP 3 had already failed.
diff --git a/REJECTED.md b/REJECTED.md
